    <item><title>得州农业部新规：雇用H-1B签证者不得申领补助</title><link>https://yongweili412.github.io/world-events/event.html?id=evt_20261030_025</link><guid isPermaLink="false">evt_20261030_025</guid><pubDate>2026-10-30</pubDate><category>经济</category><description><![CDATA[ 美国得克萨斯州农业部出台新规，规定雇用H-1B签证持有者的企业将无法获得该部门提供的补助资金。该部门称纳税人辛勤工作，相关资金应优先用于本地就业。<br><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/if-you-hire-h-1b-you-wont-get-grants-texas-agriculture-departments-new-rule-for-businesses-taxpayers-work-hard-for-their-money/articleshow/135328523.cms">来源：若聘用H-1B签证员工将无法获得拨款：得克萨斯州农业部门针对企业的新规；纳税人辛勤工作为</a> ]]></description></item>
    <item><title>爱丁堡梵高画作背面发现隐藏自画像</title><link>https://yongweili412.github.io/world-events/event.html?id=evt_20261030_026</link><guid isPermaLink="false">evt_20261030_026</guid><pubDate>2026-10-30</pubDate><category>文化</category><description><![CDATA[ 2022年，修复人员在苏格兰爱丁堡对一幅梵高画作进行X光扫描时，发现画布背面隐藏着一幅梵高自画像。该肖像被另一幅画作遮盖多年，此前不为外界所知。<br><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-2022-conservators-x-raying-a-van-gogh-painting-in-edinburgh-found-a-hidden-self-portrait-of-the-artist-on-the-back-of-the-canvas-concealed-for-more-than-a-century-under-layers-of-glue-and-cardboard/articleshow/135308668.cms">来源：2022年，修复人员在爱丁堡对梵高的一幅画作进行X光扫描时，在背面发现了这位艺术家的一幅隐藏自画像。</a> ]]></description></item>
    <item><title>西班牙3700年前口含石块的墓葬或与魔法仪式有关</title><link>https://yongweili412.github.io/world-events/event.html?id=evt_20261030_027</link><guid isPermaLink="false">evt_20261030_027</guid><pubDate>2026-10-30</pubDate><category>科技</category><description><![CDATA[ 研究人员在西班牙东南部发现一座约3700年前的墓葬，死者口中含有一块石头，葬于炉灶之下。研究者认为这一特殊葬式可能与当时的魔法或宗教仪式有关。<br><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/he-was-buried-beneath-a-hearth-with-a-large-stone-pressed-against-his-mouth-and-face-just-one-cm-below-the-floor-people-walked-on-researchers-now-suggest-the-3700-year-old-burial-was-part-of-a-magical-ritual-not-a-punishment/articleshow/135297234.cms">来源：一名3700年前的男子在壁炉下安葬，口中含石，这可能是一场魔法仪式的一部分</a> ]]></description></item>
    <item><title>英国UKHarvest将食物浪费转化为千万份餐食</title><link>https://yongweili412.github.io/world-events/event.html?id=evt_20261030_028</link><guid isPermaLink="false">evt_20261030_028</guid><pubDate>2026-10-30</pubDate><category>社会</category><description><![CDATA[ 2017年，伊冯娜·汤姆森创立慈善机构UKHarvest，致力于减少食物浪费并帮助面临食物短缺的人群。该机构迄今已将原本被丢弃的食物转化为约1000万份餐食。<br><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-2017-a-british-food-rescue-organisation-started-with-one-person-and-a-van-collecting-surplus-food-nine-years-later-ukharvest-has-rescued-10-million-meals-and-now-collects-10-tonnes-of-surplus-food-every-week/articleshow/135239446.cms">来源：UKHarvest如何将食物浪费转化为1000万份餐食</a> ]]></description></item>
    <item><title>安蒂波德斯群岛灭鼠后地面甲虫数量激增40倍</title><link>https://yongweili412.github.io/world-events/event.html?id=evt_20261030_029</link><guid isPermaLink="false">evt_20261030_029</guid><pubDate>2026-10-30</pubDate><category>军事</category><description><![CDATA[ 新西兰安蒂波德斯群岛成功清除入侵的家鼠后，当地地面甲虫数量出现显著回升，增幅达40倍。这一变化被视为岛屿生态修复成效的重要指标。<br><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-2018-antipodes-island-was-declared-free-of-invasive-mice-eight-years-later-scientists-reported-ground-beetle-numbers-40-times-higher-with-rove-beetles-up-more-than-20-fold-after-predator-removal/articleshow/135272082.cms">来源：灭鼠行动后，安蒂波迪斯岛地甲虫数量激增四十倍</a> ]]></description></item>
    <item><title>得州帝国糖厂历史建筑获1500万美元修缮资金</title><link>https://yongweili412.github.io/world-events/event.html?id=evt_20261030_030</link><guid isPermaLink="false">evt_20261030_030</guid><pubDate>2026-10-30</pubDate><category>政治</category><description><![CDATA[ 得克萨斯州舒格兰市议会批准一项1500万美元计划，用于保护标志性的帝国糖厂碳化车间建筑。该建筑已空置约20年，此次修缮旨在挽救这一当地工业遗产。<br><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/built-in-1925-and-vacant-for-over-20-years-texass-historic-imperial-sugar-char-house-survived-stalled-redevelopment-plans-the-city-has-approved-a-15-million-rescue-with-preservation-work-due-through-2028/articleshow/135268778.cms">来源：得克萨斯州历史建筑帝国糖业炼糖厂闲置20年后获1500万美元救助</a> ]]></description></item>
    <item><title>康涅狄格州拟投4.1亿美元将电厂改建滨水公园</title><link>https://yongweili412.github.io/world-events/event.html?id=evt_20261030_031</link><guid isPermaLink="false">evt_20261030_031</guid><pubDate>2026-10-30</pubDate><category>环境</category><description><![CDATA[ 康涅狄格州公布一项4.1亿美元计划，拟将一座发电厂改造为滨水公园。项目旨在盘活工业用地，为公众提供新的休闲空间。<br><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-connecticut-couple-has-committed-410-million-to-turn-a-125-acre-former-coal-and-oil-power-plant-into-a-waterfront-park-zoning-approval-moves-the-long-closed-industrial-site-closer-to-public-use/articleshow/135233466.cms">来源：4.1亿美元计划将康涅狄格州一座发电厂改建为滨水公园</a> ]]></description></item>
    <item><title>研究：服抗生素期间大量吃糖或加重肠道损伤</title><link>https://yongweili412.github.io/world-events/event.html?id=evt_20261030_032</link><guid isPermaLink="false">evt_20261030_032</guid><pubDate>2026-10-30</pubDate><category>科技</category><description><![CDATA[ 科学家发现，服用抗生素期间摄入大量糖分，可能加重对肠道的损害。研究显示，高糖饮食会明显影响患者肠道细菌的多样性，进而干扰抗生素治疗期间的肠道健康。<br><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/taking-antibiotics-eating-a-lot-of-sugar-at-the-same-time-may-make-the-damage-to-your-gut-worse-scientists-have-found-suggesting-that-what-you-eat-during-a-course-of-antibiotics-could-affect-how-well-your-body-recovers/articleshow/135303407.cms">来源：科学家发现，服用抗生素期间若同时摄入大量糖分，可能会加重对肠道造成的损害，</a> ]]></description></item>
    <item><title>日本Upbond将推JPYC稳定币退税服务</title><link>https://yongweili412.github.io/world-events/event.html?id=evt_20261030_033</link><guid isPermaLink="false">evt_20261030_033</guid><pubDate>2026-10-30</pubDate><category>经济</category><description><![CDATA[ 日本企业Upbond计划推出以JPYC稳定币结算的购物退税服务，消费者可在免税购物后以日元稳定币形式申请退税，此举旨在推动加密货币在本地零售与消费场景中的应用。<br><a href="https://asia.nikkei.com/spotlight/cryptocurrencies/japan-s-upbond-to-offer-tax-free-shopping-refunds-in-jpyc-stablecoin">来源：日本Upbond将用JPYC稳定币提供免税购物退款</a> ]]></description></item>
